infinite-patch 1
# Audio Effects: shape the sound
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 878
end
node 2 Synths Analog
  id synth
  pos 480 1024
end
node 3 AudioEffects Delay
  id echo
  pos 1340 1040
end
node 4 AudioEffects Reverb
  id room
  pos 1960 1040
end
node 5 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 2580 878
end
node 6 Modulators Audio Analyze
  id ana
  pos 0 2184
end
node 7 Source Shape
  id pic
  pos 0 162
  c fillColor 1 0.45 0.3
  f size 0.2
end
node 8 Utility Output
  id out
  pos 460 0
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Audio effects change a sound. Wire them in a row between the synth and the speakers.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 10 Compositing Comment
  pos 1340 878
  s text Delay repeats the sound. Try Feedback for more repeats and Mix for how loud they are.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 11 Compositing Comment
  pos 1960 878
  s text Reverb makes the sound feel like it is in a room. Try Size and Decay.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 12 Compositing Comment
  pos 480 878
  s text Effects sit between the sound and the speakers, in order.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
node 13 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text A small picture that follows the sound, so you can see it as well as hear it.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
note synth 0 notes
aud echo 0 synth
aud room 0 echo
aud speakers 0 room
aud ana 0 room
cable out 0 pic
mod pic sizeX ana 0 0 1 0.5 0.12 0.4
mod pic sizeY ana 0 0 1 0.5 0.12 0.4
